原文:
[!] locales/zh-CN.json has {len(padded_keys)} key(s) with leading/trailing whitespace - they can never match because the engine trims the UI text before looking it up.
    {preview}
[!] Fix the keys (or move the variable part into locales/patterns.json) and rebuild.

建议中文译文:
[!] locales/zh-CN.json 中有 {len(padded_keys)} 个键的首尾带空白 —— 引擎在查表前会裁剪界面文本，因此这些键永远无法命中。
    {preview}
[!] 请修正这些键（或将变量部分移入 locales/patterns.json）后重新构建。

原文:
[!] locales/zh-CN.json has {len(empty_values)} entry/entries with an empty translation - the engine would render an empty label.
    {preview}
[!] Fill them in or remove them and rebuild.

建议中文译文:
[!] locales/zh-CN.json 中有 {len(empty_values)} 条词条的译文为空 —— 引擎会渲染出空白标签。
    {preview}
[!] 请补全或删除这些词条后重新构建。
